[PROXY] Client-driven tool loop with no session identity (adapter=opencode): the request ends in a tool_result and carries no session key, so this and every following tool round starts a fresh SDK session. The conversation does not resume, and the model sees none of its own earlier turns. This is correct for concurrent headless workflow loops, which must not share one conversation fingerprint; an interactive client should send a session header instead — see "Session identity" in docs/configuration.md.
